{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c06n0",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "type": "TEXT",
          "textData": {
            "text": "Red light therapy and grounding are sometimes offered together as part of a quiet wellness session. It is reasonable to be curious about both. It is also useful to separate enjoying the experience from claiming that the combination has been proven to produce a specific biological result.",
            "decorations": []
          }
        }
      ],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c06s1",
      "nodes": [],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "HEADING",
      "id": "c06n1",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "type": "TEXT",
          "textData": {
            "text": "Two different approaches",
            "decorations": []
          }
        }
      ],
      "headingData": {
        "level": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c06s2",
      "nodes": [],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c06n2",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "type": "TEXT",
          "textData": {
            "text": "Red light therapy uses selected light wavelengths. Grounding products create an electrical connection to ground when used as designed. They are different interventions, and evidence about one does not automatically demonstrate a benefit from the other.",
            "decorations": []
          }
        }
      ],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c06s3",
      "nodes": [],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "HEADING",
      "id": "c06n3",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "type": "TEXT",
          "textData": {
            "text": "What red-light research can tell us",
            "decorations": []
          }
        }
      ],
      "headingData": {
        "level": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c06s4",
      "nodes": [],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c06n4",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "type": "TEXT",
          "textData": {
            "text": "Researchers have examined light-based approaches for particular outcomes, including aspects of skin appearance. Results belong to the devices, doses and populations studied. They do not establish that every panel produces every advertised benefit.",
            "decorations": []
          }
        }
      ],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c06s5",
      "nodes": [],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "HEADING",
      "id": "c06n5",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "type": "TEXT",
          "textData": {
            "text": "What grounding research can tell us",
            "decorations": []
          }
        }
      ],
      "headingData": {
        "level": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c06s6",
      "nodes": [],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c06n6",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "type": "TEXT",
          "textData": {
            "text": "One early grounding pilot involved eight men after exercise. Its exploratory design can raise research questions, but it cannot establish broad claims about inflammation, hormone balance, sleep or recovery for all clients. It did not test a combined red-light-and-grounding session.",
            "decorations": []
          }
        }
      ],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c06s7",
      "nodes": [],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c06n7",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "type": "TEXT",
          "textData": {
            "text": "Descriptions involving electrons, cortisol or cell energy should not be treated as proof that a consumer session changes those outcomes in a clinically meaningful way.",
            "decorations": []
          }
        }
      ],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c06s8",
      "nodes": [],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "HEADING",
      "id": "c06n8",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "type": "TEXT",
          "textData": {
            "text": "Does combining them make either work better?",
            "decorations": []
          }
        }
      ],
      "headingData": {
        "level": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c06s9",
      "nodes": [],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c06n9",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "type": "TEXT",
          "textData": {
            "text": "The studies cited here do not establish that grounding adds a measurable benefit to red light therapy. We therefore do not promise a stronger anti-inflammatory effect, faster tissue repair or improved hormone levels from combining the two.",
            "decorations": []
          }
        }
      ],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c06s10",
      "nodes": [],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c06n10",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "type": "TEXT",
          "textData": {
            "text": "You can still value time set aside for rest. The practical question is whether the session is comfortable, appropriate for you and consistent with what the service actually offers.",
            "decorations": []
          }
        }
      ],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c06s11",
      "nodes": [],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "HEADING",
      "id": "c06n11",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "type": "TEXT",
          "textData": {
            "text": "Before choosing a session",
            "decorations": []
          }
        }
      ],
      "headingData": {
        "level": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c06s12",
      "nodes": [],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c06n12",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "type": "TEXT",
          "textData": {
            "text": "Ask which equipment is being used, what instructions apply and what the studio is offering as an experience. Use devices only according to their instructions. If you have a medical condition or a treatment-related concern, discuss suitability with your healthcare professional.",
            "decorations": []
          }
        }
      ],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c06s13",
      "nodes": [],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
